s, haha).\n        )\n\n)\n'),(3089,'2013-05-27 23:06:47','vrijwilliger bewerkt',6,'77.171.85.142','/vrijwilligers/detail.php\r\nvwid=105\r\nArray\n(\n    [Ah_vrijwilligers] => Array\n        (\n            [Ah_personen] => Array\n                (\n                    [voornaam] => mandy -> Mandy\n                    [achternaam] => wolters -> Wolters\n                )\n\n            [Ah_contactgegevens] => Array\n                (\n                    [postcode] => 7553tc -> 7553 TC\n                    [straatnaam] => stephensonstraat -> Stephensonstraat\n                    [woonplaats] => hengelo -> Hengelo\n                    [telefoon_vast] => 0742439242 -> 074-2439242\n                    [telefoon_mobiel] => 0625581147 -> 06-25581147\n                )\n\n        )\n\n)\n'),(3090,'2013-05-27 23:07:47','vrijwilliger bewerkt',6,'77.171.85.142','/vrijwilligers/detail.php\r\nvwid=106\r\nArray\n(\n    [Ah_vrijwilligers] => Array\n        (\n            [Ah_personen] => Array\n                (\n                    [voornaam] => laura -> Laura\n                    [achternaam] => wolters -> Wolters\n                )\n\n            [Ah_contactgegevens] => Array\n                (\n                    [postcode] => 7553tc -> 7553 TC\n                    [straatnaam] => stephensonstraat -> Stephensonstraat\n                    [woonplaats] => hengelo -> Hengelo\n                    [telefoon_vast] => 0742439242 -> 074-2439242\n                    [telefoon_mobiel] => 0641934121 -> 06-41934121\n                )\n\n        )\n\n)\n'),(3091,'2013-05-27 23:10:35','vrijwilliger bewerkt',6,'77.171.85.142','/vrijwilligers/detail.php\r\nvwid=112\r\nArray\n(\n    [Ah_vrijwilligers] => Array\n        (\n            [beschikbaar_tot] => 17:00:00 -> 16:00:00\n            [lunch] => nee -> ja\n            [opmerkingen] =>  -> Kan tot 16.30 uur. Mag eventueel eerder.\n        )\n\n)\n'),(3092,'2013-05-27 23:11:29','vrijwilliger bewerkt',6,'77.171.85.142','/vrijwilligers/detai