 het Oranjeconcert, rondom Koningsdag. VGT verzorgt\\u00a0 dan een concert in\\r\\nVenray en nodigt hiervoor 2 gastkoren uit. Komend jaar zal dit optreden plaatsvinden in Zaal Zeven\\r\\n(Hotel Asteria) op woensdag 23 april. \\r\\nVGT is een hechte vocal group v\\u00f3\\u00f3r leden en gedragen d\\u00f3\\u00f3r leden, en zingt met maar liefst 7\\r\\nstemgroepen de sterren van de hemel!\"}'),(48455,'2024-12-11 18:41:32','login',14,'89.205.130.236','success'),(48456,'2024-12-11 18:42:10','enrollment-20-1501',14,'89.205.130.236','change {\"droppedout\":\"2024-12-11 18:45\"}'),(48457,'2024-12-12 19:12:23','login',8,'92.66.56.201','success'),(48458,'2024-12-13 19:43:47','login',14,'84.241.204.163','success'),(48459,'2024-12-13 19:44:18','person-6357',14,'84.241.204.163','change {\"mailing\":true}'),(48460,'2024-12-13 19:46:14','person-6357',14,'84.241.204.163','change {\"firstname\":\"Rini\",\"lastname\":\"Janssen\"}'),(48461,'2024-12-13 20:15:21','person-new',14,'84.241.204.163','change {\"firstname\":\"Ron\",\"lastname\":\"Hanssen\",\"email\":\"ronmuziekhanssen@gmail.com\"}'),(48462,'2024-12-13 20:16:06','person-new',14,'84.241.204.163','change {\"firstname\":\"Piet\",\"lastname\":\"Wetterhahn\",\"email\":\"pw@whnet.nl\",\"mailing\":true}'),(48463,'2024-12-13 20:17:14','group-1512',14,'84.241.204.163','add role {\"person\":\"Ron Hanssen\",\"role\":\"musician\"}'),(48464,'2024-12-13 20:17:14','person-6358',14,'84.241.204.163','add role {\"group\":\"Vocal Group Transparant\",\"role\":\"musician\"}'),(48465,'2024-12-13 20:17:34','group-1512',14,'84.241.204.163','delete role {\"person\":\"Ron Hanssen\",\"role\":\"musician\"}'),(48466,'2024-12-13 20:17:34','person-6358',14,'84.241.204.163','delete role {\"group\":\"Vocal Group Transparant\",\"role\":\"musician\"}'),(48467,'2024-12-13 20:18:00','group-1512',14,'84.241.204.163','add role {\"person\":\"Ron Hanssen\",\"role\":\"conductor\"}'),(48468,'2024-12-13 20:18:00','person-6358',14,'84.241.204.163','add role {\"group\":\"